# Ship it

Adam never wants a finished fix left on a branch. A draft PR is not shipped. "Ready for review" is not shipped.

When the work is done:

1. Commit
2. Push
3. Merge to `main` (do not wait for Adam to merge)
4. Confirm the production deploy started (this repo: GitHub Pages on `main`)

Do not stop at "the PR is up." Do not ask him to merge. He should not still be looking at the bug.